# 🏥 Clinical Dashboard in Tableau – Stroke Insights

This Tableau dashboard provides visual analysis of stroke patterns using real-world clinical data from hospital records. It aims to uncover trends by age, gender, and work type while tracking overall patient outcomes.

---

## 📊 Dashboard Highlights

- **📈 Stroke Trend by Age** – Understand which age groups are most affected.
- **💼 Stroke Cases by Work Type** – Explore occupational patterns in stroke diagnosis.
- **✅ KPI Card: Stroke Rate** – Key percentage of patients with stroke.
- **🧬 Stroke % by Gender & Age Group** – Detailed breakdown of high-risk subgroups.

---

## 📁 Dataset Details

- Source: [Patient Diagnosis Prediction](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/fedesoriano/stroke-prediction-dataset)
- CSV file with clinical features like age, gender, glucose level, hypertension, and stroke status.

---

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Tableau Public (for dashboard creation)
- Excel (for basic preprocessing)

---

## 💡 Insights Gained

- Stroke occurrence peaks in older age groups.
- Private sector and self-employed individuals show higher stroke counts.
- Gender disparity exists in stroke risk — requires further exploration.

